## Third-party services used at build time (not redistributed)

- **Microsoft Edge neural TTS** (`en-US-AndrewNeural` voice, via the
  `edge-tts` client): used once at build time to synthesize the walkthrough
  narration audio from the repository's own public narration text. No
  credentials are used and no visitor-runtime dependency exists; the
  synthesized audio is baked into the MP4. Use of the synthesized voice
  remains subject to Microsoft's service terms; flag for re-review before
  any commercial redistribution of the audio.
- **Mermaid / @mermaid-js/mermaid-cli** (Apache-2.0): build-time diagram
  rendering only; no Mermaid code is shipped to visitors.

## Fonts, scripts, and media from third parties

None. The site uses system font stacks only, ships no third-party
JavaScript, references no remote fonts, and redistributes no stock
photography, icon sets, or media.

## Privacy-related assets

The site sets no cookies, runs no analytics, and collects no visitor data;
the quality gate in `scripts/check_site_quality.py` enforces the absence of
known tracking patterns.
